  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan activates the immortal killer move Pure Dream Reality Seeker Transformation on a dream realm and condenses two Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique bodies from it, one intact and one handicapped, then stores them in his immortal aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        1585
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "sys_pure_dream_reality_seeker_physique"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He uses pure dream reality seeker transformation to turn dream realms in the sovereign immortal aperture into Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique bodies, then sends those temporary dream path clones into the dream realms to pull Southern Border Gu Immortals out and lock them inside the aperture. He also turns battlefield dream realms into such bodies and retrieves them before leaving.",
      "chapters": [
        1605
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "captives-and-clones",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Around Dragon Palace, Duke Long uses Pure Dream Reality Seeker Transformation to refine dozens of Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique bodies while new dream realms keep spreading from the house. The move is only rank six with limited might because its core Immortal Gu, Dream Wings, is rank six.",
      "chapters": [
        1685
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-and-core-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_dragon_palace",
        "char_duke_long",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "gu_dream_wings_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique and the killer move come from Shadow Sect wisdom path expert Old Man Yan Shi; the move is the greatest achievement of his research. His original version creates the most extreme Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique: eighteen hours of life, cultivation rising one rank every two hours, reaching rank nine at the end. In the second Yi Tian Mountain battle, Purple Mountain True Monarch uses an incomplete version with flawed bodies; Fang Yuan first holds that incomplete form, then obtains the original from Spectral Soul’s true inheritance. In Fang Yuan’s previous life Heavenly Court takes the move, and Feng Jin Huang later perfects the original despite its huge flaw, producing the perfect Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique as the eleventh extreme physique. When trading with Chi Qu You, Fang Yuan still uses the incomplete killer move so the bodies self-detonate when time runs out.",
      "chapters": [
        1775
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "origin-and-versions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
